<title>INDIA: Societe Generale cuts India prime rate to 15.0 pct.</title>
<headline>Societe Generale cuts India prime rate to 15.0 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Societe Generale bank cut its Indian prime lending rate to 15.0 percent from 16.0 percent a year with effect from July 16, a bank official said.</p>
<p>The spread above the PLR remains unchanged at 3.0 percent, he said.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
